mark in the history of Drupal. With the launch of the groundbreaking Drupal=
 Starshot, the future of Drupal is brighter than ever. This isn=E2=80=99t j=
ust an upgrade=E2=80=94it=E2=80=99s a bold leap into a new era of modernity=
, scalability and innovation.  </p>
<p>Drupaljam has always been a cornerstone for the Drupal community - a pla=
ce where professionals, developers and enthusiasts come together to share i=
deas, celebrate milestones, and shape the future of the platform. This year=
=E2=80=99s theme, =E2=80=9Cand beyond,=E2=80=9D reflects our collective amb=
ition to explore uncharted territory and redefine what=E2=80=99s possible w=
ith Drupal.  </p>
<p>Join us at De Fabrique, Utrecht, on May 21, 2025, and let=E2=80=99s take=
 flight into the next chapter of the Drupal journey.  </p>
<p>More info, see website <a href=3D"http://www.drupaljam.nl/" rel=3D"nofol=
